  "label": "rats are mapped as the entity that is about to end man",
  "description": "The top text 'european rats in the 15th century' establishes the historical context and identity of the visual entities (rats). The bottom text 'i'm about to end man' is a hyperbolic statement that is analogically mapped onto the rats. The rats, as the visual entities, are being projected as the agents of the apocalyptic threat described in the text. This mapping is based on the juxtaposition of the text and the visual material, where the rats are the subject of the metaphorical claim.",
